<title>USA: Wolverine buy to add up to $0.25 EPS in 97.</title>
<headline>Wolverine buy to add up to $0.25 EPS in 97.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTSVILLE, Ala. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wolverine Tube Inc said Monday its acquisition of Tube Forming Inc would contribute about $0.22 to $0.25 per share for 1997.</p>
<p>Wolverine said it completed the acquisition of outstanding Tube Forming stock and selected assets from two related entities for $34.25 million. The acquisition was funded through the company's available cash and borrowings under its $75 million credit facility.</p>
<p>Tube Forming had 1995 sales of about $24 million.</p>
<p>Wolverine is a manufacturer and distributor of copper and copper alloy tube.</p>
</text>
